WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:01:19.450
An astronaut with gray hair and glasses in a black shirt floats into view beside a window showing green plants. He places both hands on the glass and touches the plants inside. He reaches through the open window frame to inspect and touch the greenery. The window stays open with plants floating inside. Blue-gloved hands hold a long red pepper above a white tag reading KALE RED. Six astronauts gather in the module and float individually packaged food items toward the camera.

2
00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:49.920
Six astronauts gather in the module and float packaged food toward the camera. Blue-gloved hands hold a red pepper above a KALE RED tag.
